TEXT 32 32 Left 3 ;#327 Basic PNP current mirror with Alan's adjustable load
TEXT 32 96 Left 2 ;Source: Alan Wolke (W2AEW), https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2IbWvq7Abv4
TEXT 32 144 Left 2 ;Q1 sets about 1.1 mA through R1 and Q2 copies it into the load. Turning the R2 pot changes Q2's collector voltage, and the current changes with it.
TEXT 32 976 Left 2 ;VSENSE is ammeter M1. Vload is Alan's voltmeter across R2. R2TOP and R2BOTTOM are the 10k pot; the loop ties its wiper to the grounded end.
TEXT 32 1008 Left 2 ;RSET is the pot setting in ohms. The 1m floor is only there because LTspice rejects a 0 ohm resistor.
TEXT 32 1056 Left 2 !.step param RSET 0 10k 100
TEXT 32 1088 Left 2 !.op
